<title>HONG KONG: Sun Hung Kai Prop sees better 1996/97.</title>
<headline>Sun Hung Kai Prop sees better 1996/97.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd said on Wednesday it should see an improvement in its results during the 1996/97 financial year, after posting earnings growth of 6.5 percent in the year ended June 30.</p>
<p>&quot;Barring unforseen circumstances, the group's results for the coming year will show a satisfactory improvement,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Sun Hung Kai Properties reported 1995/96 net profit of HK$11.04 billion compared to HK$10.36 billion in the year-ago period.</p>
</text>
